0,Athabaskan languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Athabaskan_languages,"Athabaskan, also known as Dene, is a large branch of the Na-Dene language family of North America, located in western North America in three areal language groups: Northern, Pacific Coast and Southern.","Kuskokwim, Upper",Eyak-Athabaskan
