2,Upper Kuskokwim | Alaska Native Language Archive | Alaska Native...,https://www.uaf.edu/anla/collections/upper_kuskokwim/,"Guide to the Upper Kuskokwim Athabaskan Language Collection.Upper Kuskokwim Athabascan was identified as a distinct language by Krauss in 1961. In earlier literature, it was included as a dialect of Ingalik (e.g. Osgood); Hosley calls it Kolchan.","Kuskokwim, Upper",Eyak-Athabaskan
