4,Upper Kuskokwim,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/UpperKuskokwim,"Alternate names: Kolchan, Kuskokwim (Upper), Kuskokwim, Upper, Mcgrath Ingalik. Language code: kuu. Language family: Eyak-Athabaskan, Athabaskan, Northern Athabaskan (SIL classification). Number of speakers: 25.","Kuskokwim, Upper",Eyak-Athabaskan
